================================================================================
WHY AGPL-3.0
================================================================================

AGPL-3.0 was inherited from YOLOE, the open-vocabulary detector behind the
former "AI Text" tool: weights derived from an AGPL work carry that license into
whatever ships them. That lane has since been removed and nothing shipped today
derives from YOLOE, so the inheritance no longer applies — but a project's own
license does not change by itself, and relicensing is the copyright holder's
call. It remains AGPL-3.0 until they say otherwise.


